A pure JavaScript implementation of [Sass][sass]. **Sass makes CSS fun again**.

<table>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <img width="118px" alt="Sass logo" src="https://rawgit.com/sass/sass-site/master/source/assets/img/logos/logo.svg" />
